      "description": "The place \"The Clearing\" is built with a circular platform of radius 6 centered at the origin. It features a ring of pale birches arranged symmetrically around the clearing, with each tree representing a different variant of the quiver tree. A single lantern glows on a flat stone in the center, casting a warm, desaturated light that enhances the mood of the scene. The scattered field of trees adds a natural, dense coverage across the platform, creating a sense of depth and atmosphere. The scene is illuminated by a directional light that mimics the soft, low light of dusk, enhancing the desaturated and muted color palette. This design reflects the serene and atmospheric tone of the section described.",
